-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-18-melancholy-neko-and-rain/squeeze.jpg"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="alt text"&#10; width="1279"&#10; height="1706"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-18-melancholy-neko-and-rain/rain-under-streetlight_hu_59ecbd30f2554660.jpg"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-18-melancholy-neko-and-rain/rain-under-streetlight_hu_59ecbd30f2554660.jpg 800w, https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-18-melancholy-neko-and-rain/rain-under-streetlight.jpg 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-18-melancholy-neko-and-rain/rain-under-streetlight.jpg"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-18-melancholy-neko-and-rain/feature_close-up.jpg"/></item><item><title>想清楚</title><link>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-14-think-it-through/</link><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:53:03 +0800</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-14-think-it-through/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="想清楚"&#10; width="1706"&#10; height="1279"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-14-think-it-through/feature_07cc967eb0e5bc7c19fe47c1675f44f4_hu_a46fc5b32af8b041.jpg"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-14-think-it-through/feature_07cc967eb0e5bc7c19fe47c1675f44f4_hu_a46fc5b32af8b041.jpg 800w, https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-14-think-it-through/feature_07cc967eb0e5bc7c19fe47c1675f44f4_hu_eb2362e1674f6766.jpg 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-14-think-it-through/feature_07cc967eb0e5bc7c19fe47c1675f44f4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;好治愈的线代课。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;「就线性代数，它可以想的很清楚啊。比如你做题的过程中，或者书本上的一些东西，感觉看得不太清楚，要么是这个书写得不好，要么是没有花时间去想。其实线性代数里所有的东西都可以想得非常透彻啊，没有任何缝隙，会想得非常自然。」&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-14-think-it-through/feature_07cc967eb0e5bc7c19fe47c1675f44f4.jpg"/></item><item><title>周三重现</title><link>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-10-wednesday-again/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-10-wednesday-again/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="周三重现"&#10; width="1279"&#10; height="1706"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-10-wednesday-again/feature_bf148acc7caff8f884cc88dde3133d98_hu_3e41f8ccc80f7152.jpg"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-10-wednesday-again/feature_bf148acc7caff8f884cc88dde3133d98_hu_3e41f8ccc80f7152.jpg 800w, https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-10-wednesday-again/feature_bf148acc7caff8f884cc88dde3133d98.jpg 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-10-wednesday-again/feature_bf148acc7caff8f884cc88dde3133d98.jpg"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;习惯敏锐于自己缺失的，迟钝于自己拥有的。细数种种，我本就完满。&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-10-wednesday-again/feature_bf148acc7caff8f884cc88dde3133d98.jpg"/></item><item><title>树杈间的猫</title><link>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-08-neko-between-branches/</link><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-08-neko-between-branches/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="树杈间的猫"&#10; width="1706"&#10; height